---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | MyQRCodeFree"
  description="Terms of Service for MyQRCodeFree. Review our acceptable use, warranties, and terms for using our free online QR code generator."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <div class="mb-8">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
        >
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path>
          </svg>
          Back to Generator
        </a>
      </div>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs dark:border-slate-800/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60">
        <header class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-6 dark:border-slate-800/80">
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">
            Terms of Service
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            Last Updated: September 2026
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <p>
            By using myqrcodefree.com (&ldquo;the Service&rdquo;), you agree to the following terms.
          </p>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              1. Description of Service
            </h2>
            <p>
              MyQRCodeFree provides a free, browser-based tool to generate QR codes for URLs, text, WiFi credentials, contact cards (vCard), and location data. The Service is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; with no guarantees of uptime, accuracy, or fitness for a particular purpose.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              2. Acceptable Use
            </h2>
            <p>
              You agree not to use this Service to generate QR codes that:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6 marker:text-blue-500">
              <li>Link to illegal, harmful, or fraudulent content</li>
              <li>Facilitate phishing, malware distribution, or scams</li>
              <li>Violate the rights of any third party</li>
              <li>Contain content that is defamatory, obscene, or otherwise unlawful</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              We reserve the right to restrict access to anyone found abusing the Service, though since QR generation is client-side, we have no visibility into individual usage.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              3. No Warranty
            </h2>
            <p>
              The Service is provided without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee that generated QR codes will scan correctly in all conditions, devices, or scanning apps. Always test a QR code before distributing it publicly or in print.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              4. Limitation of Liability
            </h2>
            <p>
              We are not liable for any damages, direct or indirect, arising from your use of this Service, including but not limited to lost data, business interruption, or reliance on generated QR codes.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              5. Intellectual Property
            </h2>
            <p>
              The MyQRCodeFree name, logo, and website design are our property. QR codes you generate, and any content you input, remain yours &mdash; we claim no ownership over content you create using the tool.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              6. Third-Party Advertising
            </h2>
            <p>
              This site displays ads via Google AdSense. We are not responsible for the content of third-party advertisements.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              7. Changes to Terms
            </h2>
            <p>
              We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              8. Contact
            </h2>
            <p>
              Questions about these Terms can be sent to: <a href="mailto:support@myqrcodefree.com" class="font-medium text-blue-600 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300">support@myqrcodefree.com</a>
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
